SUMMARY:Deadline: Stiftung Kunstfonds: KUNSTFONDS_Publikation 2027 (up to E
 UR 24\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Grant for a single artist publication\, analog or digital forma
 ts included\, by freelance visual artists or artist duos\; media artists a
 re eligible. The call opened 1 October 2026. FUNDING: up to EUR 24\,000 pe
 r project with at least 10% own contribution (third-party funds allowed).\
 n\nOrganisation: Stiftung Kunstfonds\nLocation: Bonn\, Germany (foundation
 ). RESTRICTED: freelance visual artists or duos with primary residence in 
 Germany\; enrolled students excluded.\nAward: Up to EUR 24\,000 per public
 ation project\; a minimum 10% own contribution is required and may come fr
 om third parties. No application fee.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: http
 s://www.kunstfonds.de/foerderung/kunstfonds-publikation/bewerbung-und-verg
